      </div>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">
      OnDraft (formerly known as “The Joe Cheeks Podcast,” and “The Cheekscast”) was originally created in July 2022. After initially being a podcast discussing the state of the league and weekly predictions, it soon expanded into a fast growing YouTube channel for the 2023 NFL Draft, amassing almost 100,000 views in the span of just three months. After a long hiatus and a complete rebrand, Aleks and Ryan came together again in 2026 with the vision to overhaul and re-create the product into OnDraft, spanning various social medias and mediums, including podcast episodes, written articles, YouTube videos, and TikTok content. OnDraft is not only a passion project, but a community, with this website serving as the home base for all content and discussion. 
      </p>
